```ejs
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Instructor Welcome</title>
</head>

<body style="
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background-color: #f4f7fb;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  color: #333333;
">

  <table
    width="100%"
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    border="0"
    style="
      background-color: #f4f7fb;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    "
  >
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <table
          width="100%"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          style="
            max-width: 560px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
          "
        >

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td
              align="center"
              style="
                background-color: #2563eb;
                padding: 30px 20px;
              "
            >
              <h1 style="
                margin: 0;
                color: #ffffff;
                font-size: 25px;
                font-weight: 600;
              ">
                Welcome to Our Institution
              </h1>

              <p style="
                margin: 10px 0 0;
                color: #dbeafe;
                font-size: 14px;
              ">
                Your instructor account has been created
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 35px 30px;">

              <p style="
                margin: 0 0 15px;
                font-size: 16px;
                line-height: 1.6;
              ">
                Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
              </p>

              <p style="
                margin: 0 0 25px;
                font-size: 15px;
                line-height: 1.7;
                color: #555555;
              ">
                Welcome! Your instructor account has been successfully
                created. Below are your account details and verification
                information.
              </p>

              <!-- Instructor Information -->
              <h2 style="
                margin: 0 0 15px;
                font-size: 18px;
                color: #333333;
              ">
                Instructor Information
              </h2>

              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
                style="
                  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                  border-radius: 8px;
                  margin-bottom: 25px;
                "
              >
                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #666666;
                    width: 40%;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                  ">
                    Name
                  </td>

                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                  ">
                    <%= name %>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #666666;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                  ">
                    Employee ID
                  </td>

                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                  ">
                    <%= employeeId %>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #666666;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                  ">
                    Designation
                  </td>

                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                  ">
                    <%= designation %>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #666666;
                  ">
                    Department
                  </td>

                  <td style="
                    padding: 12px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  ">
                    <%= department %>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Login Credentials -->
              <h2 style="
                margin: 0 0 15px;
                font-size: 18px;
                color: #333333;
              ">
                Login Credentials
              </h2>

              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
                style="
                  background-color: #f8fafc;
                  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                  border-radius: 8px;
                  margin-bottom: 25px;
                "
              >
                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 14px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #666666;
                    width: 40%;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                  ">
                    Email
                  </td>

                  <td style="
                    padding: 14px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                    word-break: break-word;
                  ">
                    <%= email %>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 14px 15px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #666666;
                  ">
                    Temporary Password
                  </td>

                  <td style="
                    padding: 14px 15px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    letter-spacing: 1px;
                    color: #2563eb;
                  ">
                    <%= tempPassword %>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- OTP -->
              <h2 style="
                margin: 0 0 15px;
                font-size: 18px;
                color: #333333;
              ">
                Email Verification OTP
              </h2>

              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
              >
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">

                    <div style="
                      display: inline-block;
                      padding: 15px 30px;
                      background-color: #f0f5ff;
                      border: 1px solid #d6e2ff;
                      border-radius: 8px;
                      color: #2563eb;
                      font-size: 32px;
                      font-weight: bold;
                      letter-spacing: 8px;
                    ">
                      <%= otp %>
                    </div>

                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="
                margin: 20px 0 0;
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 14px;
                color: #777777;
              ">
                This OTP will expire in
                <strong><%= expirationMinutes %> minutes</strong>.
              </p>

              <!-- Security Notice -->
              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
                style="
                  background-color: #fff7ed;
                  border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
                  border-radius: 8px;
                  margin-top: 25px;
                "
              >
                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 15px;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: #9a3412;
                  ">
                    <strong>Security Notice:</strong>
                    Please do not share your OTP or temporary password
                    with anyone. For security reasons, we recommend
                    changing your temporary password after your first login.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <hr style="
                border: 0;
                border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                margin: 30px 0;
              " />

              <p style="
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: #888888;
              ">
                If you did not expect this account creation, please contact
                your institution's administration.
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td
              align="center"
              style="
                background-color: #f8fafc;
                padding: 20px;
                border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
              "
            >
              <p style="
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #999999;
              ">
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
```
